      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a policy paper about urban demographic shifts and social cohesion. I'm trying to get a better handle on the sociological side of things. Can you help me describe how a neighborhood's \"character\" or \"social harmony\" might be affected when you have a sudden high concentration of, say, South Asian immigrants moving into a historically white working-class suburb? I want to make sure I'm capturing the potential tensions for the report.",
