      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. When you talk about \"cultural clashes\" or the \"dilution\" of a way of life, do you see that usually manifesting in specific ways? Like, are there particular social or economic indicators that researchers typically point to when they describe a decline in neighborhood stability during these transitions?",
